-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",264,{
[8417]="700173C0\n1\tHelp Avar defeat the leaders of the Orcs within the Grand Stair\030Help Avar weaken the forces of the Moria Orcs in the Grand Stair\tAvar is at the Orc-watch. Avar has asked you to assist him with two tasks to earn his faith and satisfy him that the Orcs of the Grand Stair are no longer a serious threat.\n2\tTalk to Avar at the Orc-watch\tAvar is at the Orc-watch, south-west of the Grand Stair. Now that Avar's tasks are complete, you should return to him with your report.\n",
[8418]="700561E7\n1\tTalk to Seleflad\tSeleflad can be found at Edoras or the Eastfold Homesteads. You should talk to Seleflad.\n",
[8419]="700561DC\n1\tTalk to Burginda\tBurginda can be found at Edoras or the Kingstead Households. You should talk to Burginda.\n",
[8420]="700613A3\n1\tTalk to Wingard Puddifoot outside the entrance to Ost Lagorath\tWingard Puddifoot can be found outside the ruins north of Gamwich Talk to Wingard Puddifoot outside the ruins.\n",
[8421]="70066064\n1\tPick up the picnic basket\tTrevadron has asked you to bring meals to farmers outside the walls of Calembel. You should pick up the picnic basket and bring them their meals. The basket is next to Trevadron, in Calembel.\n2\tTrevadron has asked you bring meals to the farmers in the fields below Calembel.\t\n3\tReturn to Trevadron\tYou have fed all of the farmers working in the fields. You should return the basket to Trevadron, in Calembel.\n",
[8422]="70028819\n1\tLure and defeat Big Bloodtusk at his den\tBig Bloodtusk's den can be found in Bloodtusk's Dwelling. You should lure Big Bloodtusk, the sire of all boars in Pren Gwydh, and attempt to defeat him.\n2\tTell Louri of your victory against Big Bloodtusk\tLouri is in Galtrev. You should return at once to Louri to let her know that you have accepted her challenge to defeat Big Bloodtusk.\n",
[8423]="70028817\n1\tCollect meat from common forest-boars (total: 10)\tCommon forest-boars of the Bloodtusk family can be found throughout Pren Gwydh. You should hunt for meat from common boars in Pren Gwydh, as they generally have vicious tempers and pose quite a threat to travellers.\n2\tBring the boar-meat to Louri in Galtrev.\tLouri is in Galtrev. You should bring the boar-meat you collected to Louri.\n",
[8424]="70028818\n1\tDefeat hardy forest-boars in Bloodtusk's Dwelling (total: 10)\tThe hardy forest-boars of the Bloodtusk family can be found in Bloodtusk's Dwelling, north and west of Galtrev. You should prove your worth as a master of the hunt by defeating many of the greater boars in Pren Gwydh on their own turf.\n2\tTalk to Louri in Galtrev\tLouri is in Galtrev. You should return to Louri now that you have killed many of the vicious boars on their own turf.\n",
[8425]="70054681\n1\tTalk to Rhadrog\tRhadrog can be found in Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire. You should talk to Rhadrog.\n2\tListen to Rhadrog's story in 'The Red Sky Darkens'\tRhadrog would like to tell you the tale of how he left Agarnaith with Faeron. You should complete 'The Red Sky Darkens'.\n3\tTalk to Rhadrog\tRhadrog can be found in Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire. You should talk to Rhadrog.\n4\tTalk to Faeron\tFaeron can be found in Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire. You should talk to Faeron.\n5\tTalk to Dolenthol\tDolenthol can be found in Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire. You should talk to Dolenthol.\n",
[8426]="7004117A\n1\tPatrol the roadway into Tarlang's Crown\tThe road to Tarlang's Crown can be found to the north of Edhellond in Belfalas. Harnion has asked you to patrol the road into Tarlang's Crown in hopes of discovering more of the Heirs' plans and their numbers.\n2\tPatrol deeper into Tarlang's Crown\tThe road to Tarlang's Crown can be found to the north of Edhellond in Belfalas. You have breached the first line of defence. You should continue patrolling the road and learn more of the Heirs' plans and numbers.\n3\tPatrol deeper into Tarlang's Crown\tThe road to Tarlang's Crown can be found to the north of Edhellond in Belfalas. You have encountered the Dead in Tarlang's Crown. You should continue patrolling the road and learn more of the Heirs' plans and numbers.\n4\tTalk to Harnion\tHarnion can be found along the road through Tarlang's Crown, to the north of Edhellond in Belfalas. You have explored as far as you dare to for now, and should now return to Harnion.\n",
[8427]="7001BA84\n1\tBring the choice wolf-meat to Sam Thistlebur\030Collect choice cuts of wolf-meat (total: 10)\tWolves can be found within the Midgewater Pass. Sam Thistelbur is at his camp, west of the wolf-haunts. Sam Thistlebur asked you to strip choice cuts of meat from the wolves you hunt within the Midgewater Pass.\n",
[8428]="70026E4D\n1\tHunt game beasts of Trum Dreng (total: 10)\tBoar and oxen roam the rough plains around Trum Dreng. You have been asked to hunt the beasts of Trum Dreng for the Feast of the Running Stag that takes place tonight.\n2\tBring the game-meat to Hav\tHav can be found in Lhan Tarren, the Stag-clan's village in Trum Dreng. You should bring the meat you collected to Hav at once so that she can begin roasting it for the feast.\n",
[8429]="700082A9\n1\tBring the aurochs-meat to Elder Tahvo\030Collect slabs of aurochs-meat (total: 4)\tThe aurochs herds roam the foothills and plains of eastern Nan Amlug. Elder Tahvo has asked you to impress him by hunting aurochs for their meat.\n",
[8430]="70068350\n1\tCollect crocodile meat ([see journal]/14)\tTevurin directed you to make your way south and east to the shoreline to hunt crocodiles for meat. Chefs in Umbar Baharbêl use the meat to cook for the masses.\n2\tYou collected what you believe is about a stone's worth of crocodile meat. Return the meat to Tevurin at the hunter's expedition in the southeast of the Cape of Umbar.\t\n",
[8431]="7001938B\n1\tCollect cuts of boar-meat (total: 8)\tBoars can often be found roaming the forest north of the banquet grounds along the eastern border of Gelirdor. Hadhelen has requested that you fetch boar-meat for the main course of the feast.\n2\tTalk to Hadhelen at the Vineyards of Lórien\tHadhelen is at the Vineyards of Lórien, far to the south of Gelirdor. You should return to Hadhelen with the meat he requested.\n",
[8432]="70025BFE\n1\tCollect elk-haunches (total: 8)\tElk can be found wandering the hills north and east of Ost Forod. Ballard Wilmer asked you to gather elk-meat so he can dry and cure it for the winter.\n2\tBring elk-haunches to Ballard Wilmer at Ost Forod\tBallard Wilmer is at Ost Forod. Ballard Wilmer will be eager to begin drying and curing the elk-meat.\n",
[8433]="7007161A\n1\tCollect tortoise meat (total: 15)\tKâbtam has asked you to hunt the dread-tortoises for their meat. You should defeat dread-tortoises in Idagâl and collect their meat.\n2\tTalk to Kâbtam\tYou have collected enough tortoise meat to feed the escapees at Dur Nâgu. You should return to Kâbtam.\n",
[8434]="70059777\n1\tCollect meats in the Wildwood (total: 10)\tMeat can be found on some large game in the Wildwood. You should collect meats.\n2\tPlace the meats in a storage crate\tA storage crate can be found in either Trader's Wharf or Trestlebridge. You should place the meats in a storage crate.\n",
[8435]="70071B31\n1\tBring supplies to Lóburdith\tMírthar does not have the strength to make the healing concoction and has asked that you bring the supplies to Lóburdith, the healer in Sul Madásh, as she will be able to help.\n2\tMix the healing concoction ingredients\tLóburdith has asked for your help making the healing concoction that Mírthar needs. Use the table nearby to create the mixture.\n3\tCombine healing concoction\tLóburdith has asked for your help making the healing concoction that Mírthar needs. Use the table nearby to create the mixture.\n4\tBring the completed concoction to Lóburdith\tYou have successfully created the concoction that Mírthar needs. Return to Lóburdith so that she can do the final preparations.\n",
[8436]="7002FEB8\n1\tTalk to a guard outside the Mead Hall\tHarwick's Mead Hall can be found at the highest point in town. You should speak with a guard outside of the Mead Hall to gain an audience with Harding, Aldor of the Eastemnet.\n2\tReceive an introduction to Harwick's Thane\tHarwick's Mead Hall can be found atop the tallest hill in town. The Mead Hall of Harwick is the main gathering area for both the townsfolk and the soldiers. The Hall is off-limits to the townsfolk at the moment while the head soldiers gather for an important discussion.\n3\tTalk to Captain Agelmund\tCaptain Agelmund, overseer of defences outside of Harwick, is stationed at Feldburg, the largest military fort in the Wold. You should speak with Captain Agelmund.\n",
[8437]="70028446\n1\tTalk to the dwarf Dagoras spoke of\tThe dwarf Dagoras spoke of can be found near some caves some distance to the north-west of Dagoras' camp. The dwarf that Dagoras described is reminiscent of Ondor, whom you met in the Heathfells.\n",
[8438]="70067499\n1\tSpeak with Magistrate Zebulo at the crest of Jax Phanâl\tNew arrivals must meet with the magistrate. The magistrate is at the crest of Jax Phanâl north of the stable-master, beyond the first right through the arch and at the top of the stairs. Visit Magistrate Zebulo now.\n",
[8439]="70020DB7\n1\tTalk to Iolo Brochtû at Maur Tulhau\tIolo Brochtû resides at a large house at the end of the road leading into Maur Tulhau, north-west from Rhus Cornchúthur. Rhus Cornchúthur told you to speak with the mayor, Iolo Brochtû.\n",
[8440]="70057849\n1\tFind Mozbuk\tUnwary travellers in Misthallow have long been preyed upon by a foul hobgoblin known as Mozbuk. Through courage and force of will, you may put an end this reign of terror.\n2\tDefeat Mozbuk\tMozbuk the Hobgoblin delights in feasting upon unwary travellers in Misthallow. Only by facing him with might and courage can his reign of terror be ended.\n3\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n",
[8441]="7001AAC5\n1\tTalk to Graeme Tenderlarch at the Bree Town Hall\tThe Bree Town Hall is found at the court near the Mustering Hall, south of Second-watcher Heathstraw's post. Second-watcher Heathstraw has asked you to make your way to the Bree Town Hall and speak with Graeme Tenderlarch, the mayor.\n",
[8442]="7005B50A\n1\tTalk to Shúkurz\tShúkurz can take you to the Quartermaster. You should talk to him when you're ready.\n2\tReturn to Náin in Aslíf\tYou and Shúkurz have successfully found the location of Dhúrstrok. You should return to Náin in Aslíf with the news.\n3\tTalk to Múta\tNáin does not seem to be present in Aslíf, but Múta is. You should talk to her.\n",
[8443]="70018E1B\n1\tDefeat the leader of the intruders in Mekeb-faham\tThe entrance to Mekeb-faham lies within Hadudbâb. Darri has instructed you to enter Mekeb-faham and defeat the creature leading the intruders.\n2\tTalk to Darri at Hadudbâb\tDarri is at Hadudbâb. You should return to Darri with news of your success.\n",
[8444]="70018E21\n1\tBring the Dwarf-prose to Darri at Hadudbâb in Durin's Way\030Collect dwarf-prose (total: 8)\tThe entrance to Mekeb-faham lies within Hadudbâb. Darri has asked you to enter Mekeb-faham and collect any dwarf-prose you may find.\n",
[8445]="70018E22\n1\tDefeat intruders in Mekeb-faham (total: 20)\tThe entrance to Mekeb-faham lies within Hadudbâb. Darri has asked you to assist him in clearing Mekeb-faham of the vermin within.\n2\tTalk to Darri at Hadudbâb\tDarri can be found at Hadudbâb along the southern road in Durin's Way. You should return to Darri to receive a reward for your efforts.\n",
[8446]="70018E25\n1\tBring the nostalgic stories to Orvar at Hadudbâb in Durin's Way\030Collect nostalgic stories (total: 8)\tThe entrance to Mekeb-farak lies within Hadudbâb. Orvar Steeleye has asked you to bring him any tales of adventure you may find in your own adventure within Mekeb-farak.\n",
[8447]="70018E24\n1\tDefeat the leader of the intruders in Mekeb-farak\tThe entrance to Mekeb-farak lies within Hadudbâb. Orvar Steeleye of the Iron Garrison is reluctant to abandon his post and his charge Darri in order to fulfill his duties. In light of this, he has tasked you with entering Mekeb-farak and defeating the leader of the intruders within its halls.\n2\tTalk to Orvar at Hadudbâb\tOrvar Steeleye is at Hadudbâb. You should return to Orvar with news of your success.\n",
[8448]="70018E20\n1\tDefeat intruders in Mekeb-farak (total: 20)\tThe entrance to Mekeb-farak lies within Hadudbâb. Orvar Steeleye has asked you to assist him in clearing Mekeb-farak of the vermin within.\n2\tTalk to Orvar Steeleye at Hadudbâb\tOrvar can be found at Hadudbâb along the southern road of Durin's Way. You should return to Orvar to receive a reward for your efforts.\n",
})
